            <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Caches and build output are deleted after review, so the space comes back at once. Your own files still go to Trash.</li><li>New cleanups: Xcode leftovers, Android images, JetBrains, Expo, Playwright, Gradle downloads, logs, and more. Each tool is asked where its cache really is.</li><li>Hibernate stale projects with the commands that bring them back, and offload big files to another drive with a verified copy.</li><li>One low-space alert per crossing, with a Free up space button.</li></ul>
]]></description>
